{"abstract":"KRONIK: Vi har et stort hul i forskningsbaseret viden om skrøbelige, ældre patienter. Det bør der rettes op på nu med en national strategi. Af hensyn til patienter og pårørende – og til det samlede sundhedsvæsen, som vil få et stejlt stigende antal patienter over 80 år.","author_count":25,"contributors":["Suetta, Charlotte","Helge, Jørn Wulff","Schultz, Martin","Waldorff, Frans Boch","Holm, Ellen Astrid","Christensen, Mikkel Bring","Kjaer, Michael","Linneberg, Allan","Sørensen, Torben Lykke","Overgaard, Søren","Møller, Tom","Holm, Anne","Kristiansen, Maria","Tetens, Inge","Paulin Hansen, John","Eiken, Pia Agnete","Kristensen, Morten Tange","Nielsen, Dennis Sandris","Kayser, Lars","K. Zebis, Mette","Kruse, Christina Rostrup","Jespersen, Astrid Pernille","Scheibye-Knudsen, Morten","Beck, Anne Marie","Jørgensen, Niklas Rye"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-820491"],"filters":{"added":"2025-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vi har brug for en national strategi for forskning i skrøbelige ældre patienter","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dagensmedicin.dk/vi-har-brug-for-en-national-strategi-for-forskning-i-skroebelige-aeldre-patienter/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-820491","ids":["ku-f8972099-9a85-43cc-be68-4090011c55fe"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-8C6D94741ADC5E0591FD79D697108A66"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dagensmedicin.dk/vi-har-brug-for-en-national-strategi-for-forskning-i-sk