{"abstract":"Replik — Det er en falliterklæring, når to forskere fra Københavns Universitet skriver, at KU’s arbejde med at reducere sit klimaaftryk hæmmer forskningen. Hvis ikke universiteterne skal være med til at vise vejen, hvem skal så?","author_count":32,"contributors":["Bjerre, Liv","Ejsing, Mads","Papazu, Irina","Racimo, Fernando","Jørgensen, Michael Søgaard","el-Wakil, Alice","Rigkos-Zitthen, Ioannis","Nielsen, Anne Bach","Jordal, Niklas Braarud","Christiansen, Kirstine Lund","Fals, Katinka Bundgård","Christensen, Søren","Horn, Laura","Andersen, Gregers","Buerkert, Johanna Sophie","Lund, Jens Friis","Olsen, Frederik Appel"],"cuid":["S02-097.88-681344"],"filters":{"added":"2023-09","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"selvfølgelig skal ku føre en ambitiøs klimapolitik","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://uniavisen.dk/selvfoelgelig-skal-ku-foere-en-ambitioes-klimapolitik/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-097.88-681344","ids":["au-19175683-7dc8-45ff-b2bd-1511fab557c6","ku-0653abee-ef5b-4071-b12a-86168d78a899"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-C15BC5046B8C1F2D64C079B4E58E236F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://uniavisen.dk/selvfoelgelig-skal-ku-foere-en-ambitioes-klimapolitik/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus Univer