{"abstract":"The public will play a vital role in shaping the future of the drone sector. The sector’s fate is tied to factors such as the capacity to serve the public and convince it that drones can benefit society, the ability to ensure that drones are used in a safe and considerate manner, and the readiness and effectiveness of the sector to address public concerns, such as safety and privacy. This report addresses public reactions to drones in residential and public settings and the concerns they raised. We present the results of two studies conducted as part of a collaborative project between the University of Southern Denmark (SDU), Aalborg University (AAU) and the Danish Transport, Construction and Housing Authority. The report builds upon and supplements the research conducted in the initial phase of the project (Bajde et al. 2017).","author_count":11,"contributors":["Bajde, Domen","Woerman, Niklas","Bruun, Maja Hojer","Gahrn-Andersen, Rasmus","Sommer, Jannek K.","Nøjgaard, Mikkel","Christensen, Sofie Heidenheim","Kirschner, Heiko","Jensen, Rune Hagel Skaarup","Bucher, Jan Hendrik"],"cuid":["S02-086.98-007167"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["hum","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"public reactions to drone use in residential and public areas","src":["aau","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/134147356/Report_Public_reactions_to_drone_use_in_residential_and_public_areas.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-086.98-007167","ids":["aau-940d1038-b1e8-4a20-bd38-2e7b95367c86","sdu-f9fd3f73-3802-431e-a419-827e3402a913"],"l