{"abstract":"Artiklen problematiserer og viser gennem et konkret undervisningseksempel, hvordan læringsprocesser, som relaterer sig til objekter, samlinger og kuratoriske processer kan integreres i danskfaget. En øvelse på Karen Blixen Museet i Nordsjælland eksemplificerer i et enkelt nedslag, hvordan æstetiske læreprocesser fremmer forbindelser mellem danskfagets litterære og sproglige indhold og andre æstetiske områder. Øvelsen pointerer, at man ved flytte andre objekter, steder og områder ind i faget og give dem et formål i undervisningen, kan udvikle nye måder at angribe og forstå faget, undervisning og læring på; foruden variationer og tilføjelser til det faglige inventar pointerer artiklen, at læring afhænger af rum, og at skift og variationer i omgivelserne samtidigt kan føre andre erkendelsesmåder med sig. Teksten belyser dele af mit forskningsprojekt ved Institut for Nordiske Studier og Sprogvidenskab på Københavns Universitet; i en universitetspædagogisk ramme undersøger det uformelle og æstetiske undervisnings- og læringsformer på dansk, hvor fokus er rettet mod materielle, museologiske og kunstneriske genstandsfelter og mod de erkendelsesformer, læring i relation til disse felter kan afstedkomme.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Christensen, Line Hjorth"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-428192"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vejene mellem sprog og museum æstetisk læring i danskfaget","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.kau.se/nofa3","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-428192","ids":["ku-3a50bc54-e47e-40b7-a85b-6682ca9efc14"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-1858C301C13E375F22EC00DCF36F209E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.kau.se/nofa3","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Nordic Studies and Linguistics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Line Hjorth","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"f0a61821-7055-41d2-bbe9-36747961dd04","name":"Christensen, Line Hjorth","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Bengt","key":"schüllerqvistpedh","last":"Schüllerqvist","name":"Schüllerqvist, Bengt","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Niklas","key":"gererickepedh","last":"Gerericke","name":"Gerericke, Niklas","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9789186637064"],"pages":"1-18","publisher":"Karlstad University Press","status":"p","subtitle":"ett urval av artiklar presenterade vid den tredje nordiska ämnesdidaktikkonferensen (NOFA 3) vid Karlstads Universitet, 2011","title":"Ämnesdidaktisk komparation - Länder, ämnen, teorier, metoder, frågor och resultat"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-3a50bc54-e47e-40b7-a85b-6682ca9efc14"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Vejene mellem sprog og museum. Æstetisk læring i danskfaget.","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-428192","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Long-term stability of titanium implants are dependent on a variety of factors. Nanocoating with organic molecules is one of the methods used to improve osseointegration. Therefore, the aim of this study is to evaluate the in vitro effect of nanocoating with pectic rhamnogalacturonan-I (RG-I) on surface properties and osteoblasts response. Three different RG-Is from apple and lupin pectins were modified and coated on amino-functionalized tissue culture polystyrene plates (aminated TCPS). Surface properties were evaluated by scanning electron microscopy, contact angle measurement, atomic force microscopy, and X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy. The effects of nanocoating on proliferation, matrix formation and mineralization, and expression of genes (real-time PCR) related to osteoblast differentiation and activity were tested using human osteoblast-like SaOS-2 cells. It was shown that RG-I coatings affected the surface properties. All three RG-I induced bone matrix formation and mineralization, which was also supported by the finding that gene expression levels of alkaline phosphatase, osteocalcin, and collagen type-1 were increased in cells cultured on the RG-I coated surface, indicating a more differentiated osteoblastic phenotype. This makes RG-I coating a promising and novel candidate for nanocoatings of implants.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Gurzawska, Katarzyna Aleksandra","Svava, Rikke","Syberg, Susanne","Yihua, Yu","Haugshøj, Kenneth Brian","Damager, Iben","Ulvskov, Peter","Christensen, Leif Højslet","Gotfredsen, Klaus","Jørgensen, Niklas Rye"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-522146"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Animals","Cell Line","Coated Materials Biocompatible","Humans","Lupinus","Malus","Materials Testing","Microscopy Atomic Force","Molecular Structure","Nanostructures","Osseointegration","Osteoblasts","Pectins","Photoelectron spectroscopy","Prostheses and Implants","Surface Properties"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"effect of nanocoating with rhamnogalacturonan i on surface properties and osteoblasts response","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/jbm.a.33311","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-522146","identifier":[{"id":"22213456","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84856219829","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-d76f3fcd-0d7d-4a48-b8a2-af5cd0be76cf"],"keyword":["Animals","Cell Line","Coated Materials, Biocompatible","Humans","Lupinus","Malus","Materials Testing","Microscopy, Atomic Force","Molecular Structure","Nanostructures","Osseointegration","Osteoblasts","Pectins","Photoelectron Spectroscopy","Prostheses and Implants","Surface Properties"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C82CCE3DF61B75126B5D22110D819F93"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/jbm.a.33311","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Odontology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen